###############################################################################
# KI5 General Fixes - .gitignore for a Project Zomboid Lua mod
###############################################################################

## Test harness build output
# The runner is compiled from tests/harness/TestRunner.java on demand.
tests/build/

## Python bytecode from the generators
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## IDE / editor cruft
.idea/
.vscode/
.vs/
*.iml
*.code-workspace
*.swp
*~

## OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

## Logs and crash artefacts, wherever they land
*.log
hs_err_pid*.log
logs/

###############################################################################
# Local-only reference material. NOT for publication.
#
# other-mods/ holds the unpacked source of the mods this one patches and the
# libraries it sits on top of: KI5's vehicles and mini-fixes, that DAMN Library,
# Specific Loot and Yet Another PZ Library. It is other people's work under
# other people's terms, kept locally so the fixes can be written against what
# the game actually loads. Publishing it would be redistributing it.
#
# example-script-*.lua are the author's own scripts from an unrelated project,
# kept as a style reference only.
#
# Remove an entry only if you deliberately intend to publish it.
# See NOTICE and LICENSE.
###############################################################################
external-files/
context-files/
bug-reports/
other-mods/
photoshop/
example-script-*.lua
NOTES.md
